# Telecommunications for the Humanities and Social Sciences.

**Authors:** Slatta, Richard W.

## Abstract
Discusses academic information and communications needs of college and university researchers, and describes structure, uses, costs, advantages, and limitations of ScholarNet, an international computer network providing professionals in the humanities and social sciences with current professional news, a medium for data and text sharing, teleconferencing, electronic mail, and other services. (MBR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ342852

